Package: bionemor
Title: Run NVIDIA BioNeMo Recipes Workflows from R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Tomasz", "Kalinowski", , "kalinowskit@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Run versioned biological foundation-model workflows through
    NVIDIA BioNeMo Recipes. The package manages GPU runtimes, model sources,
    durable jobs, and portable R results. It provides R interfaces for
    Evo 2 DNA workflows and ESM-2 protein embeddings. Model operations require
    a supported CUDA-capable NVIDIA GPU; there is no CPU fallback. Slurm
    support is experimental.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/t-kalinowski/bionemor
BugReports: https://github.com/t-kalinowski/bionemor/issues
OS_type: unix
SystemRequirements: Linux, supported CUDA-capable NVIDIA GPU, Docker with NVIDIA
    Container Toolkit (for the package-managed container runtime)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    generics,
